    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_1305_friend_06",
      "hash64": "478BA857948967DE",
      "text": "I knew that thing was fake...but it...\\c\\nWhen it said my name, using h[VAR 0x1107(0000,0202)]eris voice and\\nwearing h[VAR 0x1107(0000,0202)]eris face...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
